      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "For travelers, Dừng ở đây được rồi is the phrase to keep ready for \"You can stop here\" in rides, routes, pickup points, and stops. This is for when you want the driver to stop at the current spot. This is the safe phrase for the last turn or final stop. It works best when you focus on making the next practical step easy for the other person to choose. The forms below help you choose the version that fits the person, setting, or level of politeness.",
