      "body": "Use Dừng ở đây được rồi as your first sentence for \"You can stop here\". This is for when you want the driver to stop at the current spot. Leave a short pause after the phrase so the other person can answer with a clear reply, a pointed detail, or a simple follow-up. Keep the map, address, or destination visible while you speak so the reply points to the same place.",
